# ---- shapes the exchange declines, whose answers must be the written ones ----

# COUNT(*) over a grouped side that can go missing: a missing partial counted nothing, which is what
# COUNT(col) answered there and not what COUNT(*) did -- it counted the padded row. Declined, so this is the
# written query's answer.
